# secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# local working context, not deliverables — see the scratchpad backups
CLAUDE.md
DECISIONS.md

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# run artefacts
out/*
!out/charts/

# The committed metrics artefact. Every number in the README is checked against
# it by CHT-3, so it is a deliverable rather than a run artefact. It lived under
# out/charts/ until CP13.1 only because that was the one negation already here,
# which made a data file sit in an images directory.
!out/metrics.json

# The timing figures train.py writes and the SF-2 decomposition the evaluation
# side adds. Committed for the same reason as metrics.json: CHT-3 checks the
# README against it. Added with `git add -f` at CP13.2 and CP13.3 before this
# line existed, which is the workaround out/razorpay_demo.json needed between
# CP12 and CP12.1.
!out/model_report.json

# The viewer's data. Committed for the same reason as the two above: the page
# is a deliverable and VIW-1 checks the committed copy against the one embedded
# in viewer/index.html.
!out/viewer_data.json

# The Razorpay edge artefact and the voice replay. Both needed `git add -f` at
# the checkpoint that created them, because `.gitignore` was not on that
# checkpoint's allowlist — the third time in a row, which is what prompted the
# audit here.
#
# Everything committed under `out/` now carries its own negation, so nothing is
# tracked only because it was once forced in. Audited at CP16 against every path
# in `git ls-files out/`.
!out/razorpay_demo.json
!out/voice_demo.json

# The raw Razorpay webhook events stay on the machine that received them.
# Razorpay's checkout SMS-verifies the payer's phone number, so a real payment
# carries a real mobile number. out/razorpay_demo.json publishes a contact-free
# projection instead, and the hash chain is defined over that projection — see
# scripts/razorpay_demo.py. These two lines are redundant with `out/*` today and
# are here so the intent survives anyone adding an `!out/...` negation later.
out/razorpay_raw*.json
out/razorpay_demo_state.json

# tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
